2026-10-28T17:38:49.1638724Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011cgVyNqY6JAddrqAYXq4Rs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 24,\n3\t  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/24\",\n4\t  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Support platform_version on aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime\",\n6\t  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\nThe Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime API supports a `platformVersion` (`V1` / `V2`) on `CreateAgentRuntime` and `UpdateAgentRuntime`, and returns it from `GetAgentRuntime`. `V2` (\\\"the new AgentCore Runtime\\\") provides elastic memory and consistent, snapshot-based fast cold starts. The `aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime` resource does not currently expose this field, so Terraform users can't select or change the runtime's platform version. This enhancement adds an optional `platform_version` argument.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) and/or Data Source(s)\\n\\n* `aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime`\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime\\\" \\\"example\\\" {\\n  agent_runtime_name = \\\"example\\\"\\n  role_arn           = aws_iam_role.example.arn\\n  platform_version   = \\\"V2\\\"\\n\\n  agent_runtime_artifact {\\n    container_configuration {\\n      container_uri = \\\"123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/example:latest\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  network_configuration {\\n    network_mode = \\\"PUBLIC\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### References\\n\\n* CreateAgentRuntime: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore-control/latest/APIReference/API_CreateAgentRuntime.html\\n* UpdateAgentRuntime: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore-control/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateAgentRuntime.html\\n* Platform versions (devguide): https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore/latest/devguide/runtime-how-it-works.html#platform-versions\\n* The new AgentCore Runtime (what's new): https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/09/new-agentcore-runtime-generally-available/\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nYes \\u2014 implemented in `[#50236](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/pull/50236)`.\\n\\n\",\n7\t  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n8\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n9\t  \"labels\": [],\n10\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:09:07Z\",\n11\t  \"as_of\": \"2026-10-01T23:12:23Z\"\n12\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a82c77a0-aebc-4e46-839c-7dfffbd63a23","uuid":"967fe87a-0e6b-4d87-bba1-56664d19b5ea","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:38:49.158Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 24,\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/24\",\n  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n  \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Support platform_version on aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime\",\n  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\nThe Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime API supports a `platformVersion` (`V1` / `V2`) on `CreateAgentRuntime` and `UpdateAgentRuntime`, and returns it from `GetAgentRuntime`. `V2` (\\\"the new AgentCore Runtime\\\") provides elastic memory and consistent, snapshot-based fast cold starts. The `aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime` resource does not currently expose this field, so Terraform users can't select or change the runtime's platform version. This enhancement adds an optional `platform_version` argument.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) and/or Data Source(s)\\n\\n* `aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime`\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_bedrockagentcore_agent_runtime\\\" \\\"example\\\" {\\n  agent_runtime_name = \\\"example\\\"\\n  role_arn           = aws_iam_role.example.arn\\n  platform_version   = \\\"V2\\\"\\n\\n  agent_runtime_artifact {\\n    container_configuration {\\n      container_uri = \\\"123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/example:latest\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  network_configuration {\\n    network_mode = \\\"PUBLIC\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### References\\n\\n* CreateAgentRuntime: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore-control/latest/APIReference/API_CreateAgentRuntime.html\\n* UpdateAgentRuntime: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore-control/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateAgentRuntime.html\\n* Platform versions (devguide): https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore/latest/devguide/runtime-how-it-works.html#platform-versions\\n* The new AgentCore Runtime (what's new): https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/09/new-agentcore-runtime-generally-available/\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nYes \\u2014 implemented in `[#50236](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/pull/50236)`.\\n\\n\",\n  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"labels\": [],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:09:07Z\",\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-10-01T23:12:23Z\"\n}","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011cgVyNqY6JAddrqAYXq4Rs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
